(5021125, 732837, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the angle of this photo.  His Back is in focus, the rest of the photo isn''t, so that eyes get drawn to the plain, blue area.  I think it would have been better if his haands etc were the focus, his back could then have been soft, and our eyes would have been drawn to his hands (and the soft guy beyond them) giving the photo more of an effect</td>', 'Not sure about the angle of this photo.  His Back is in focus, the rest of the photo isn''t, so that eyes get drawn to the plain, blue area.  I think it would have been better if his haands etc were the focus, his back could then have been soft, and our eyes would have been drawn to his hands (and the soft guy beyond them) giving the photo more of an effect', '2008-10-22 21:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021126, 732897, 96881, '<td valign="top">The close crop of this area does not show the size or granduer of the place.  A wider view showing a large, sprawling Place might of worked better than this.</td>', 'The close crop of this area does not show the size or granduer of the place.  A wider view showing a large, sprawling Place might of worked better than this.', '2008-10-22 21:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021130, 732785, 96881, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, however I am unsure of why a Telescope really fits the c hallenge....<br/>Ignoring that though<br/>The colour through the sky is great.  The foreground/hills though are too dark for my liking.  The Dome looks good, but slightly lighter would not have hurt.  Shame about the Steel tower in front of the Dome.</td>', 'This is a great photo, however I am unsure of why a Telescope really fits the c hallenge....Ignoring that thoughThe colour through the sky is great.  The foreground/hills though are too dark for my liking.  The Dome looks good, but slightly lighter would not have hurt.  Shame about the Steel tower in front of the Dome.', '2008-10-22 21:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021138, 732467, 96881, '<td valign="top">I guess this is an exlusive club.  The photo looks a little soft and the upject is relatively uninspiring</td>', 'I guess this is an exlusive club.  The photo looks a little soft and the upject is relatively uninspiring', '2008-10-22 21:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021235, 732807, 96881, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting could have been better for this photo.  The photo also does not appear sharp.  For these simple photos to work, they need to be very sharp, and the lighting needs to make it stand out</td>', 'I think the lighting could have been better for this photo.  The photo also does not appear sharp.  For these simple photos to work, they need to be very sharp, and the lighting needs to make it stand out', '2008-10-22 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021240, 732430, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea nad nice view.  However, a closer zoom of the building could have been a little better (but then you would loose the framing)  The eyes are drawn to the trees and building, but they are too small to really see any detail.</td>', 'Nice idea nad nice view.  However, a closer zoom of the building could have been a little better (but then you would loose the framing)  The eyes are drawn to the trees and building, but they are too small to really see any detail.', '2008-10-22 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021244, 731534, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overall composition of the photo does not appeal to me.  I struggle to find where I should focus attention.  Tehnoverblown parts of the white material os distracting, while the flat light on the face doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The overall composition of the photo does not appeal to me.  I struggle to find where I should focus attention.  Tehnoverblown parts of the white material os distracting, while the flat light on the face doesn''t work for me.', '2008-10-22 22:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021245, 732790, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Boat.  A shallower Depth of field may have helped remove the distracting clutter in the background and made the boat really stand out.  The crop also seems a little close.  A little more water in front would have been good.</td>', 'Nice Boat.  A shallower Depth of field may have helped remove the distracting clutter in the background and made the boat really stand out.  The crop also seems a little close.  A little more water in front would have been good.', '2008-10-22 22:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021251, 732881, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the angle this was taken on.  I think it works really well, however I feel that the glass should have been in focus, while still keeping a really shallow depth of field that has the background bottles very soft.</td>', 'I like the angle this was taken on.  I think it works really well, however I feel that the glass should have been in focus, while still keeping a really shallow depth of field that has the background bottles very soft.', '2008-10-22 22:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021252, 732898, 98489, '<td valign="top">this is really cool but it would have been better if you zoomed in on the diamond :]<br/>[also a weeeeeee bit out of focus.]</td>', 'this is really cool but it would have been better if you zoomed in on the diamond :][also a weeeeeee bit out of focus.]', '2008-10-22 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021254, 732898, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very Simple, perhaps a little too much.  The diamond is completely dwarfed by the spoon.</td>', 'Very Simple, perhaps a little too much.  The diamond is completely dwarfed by the spoon.', '2008-10-22 22:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021256, 732754, 98489, '<td valign="top">love it, might have been better if you could have got that white look to only the diamond though</td>', 'love it, might have been better if you could have got that white look to only the diamond though', '2008-10-22 22:54:01.000000', NULL, 1);
