(5021508, 732508, 94601, '<td valign="top">hmm. Nice. I think the reflection from this angle is a little too harsh.  Maybe try shooting it from a lower angle?  That would give a nice bit of depth too (i.e. one pen in front of another further back).  Other than that, great exposure and lighting and well framed. (Nice pens too!!! I have a bit of a pen fetish... haha)</td>', 'hmm. Nice. I think the reflection from this angle is a little too harsh.  Maybe try shooting it from a lower angle?  That would give a nice bit of depth too (i.e. one pen in front of another further back).  Other than that, great exposure and lighting and well framed. (Nice pens too!!! I have a bit of a pen fetish... haha)', '2008-10-23 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5021516, 732712, 94601, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  There are a lot of pictures in this challenge with jewelry, but this is a nice twist.  The diamonds look nice, but the texture and contrast in the hands and even in the reflection is phenomenal.  You have my first 10 of the challenge so far!</td>', 'Fantastic.  There are a lot of pictures in this challenge with jewelry, but this is a nice twist.  The diamonds look nice, but the texture and contrast in the hands and even in the reflection is phenomenal.  You have my first 10 of the challenge so far!', '2008-10-23 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
