(5023434, 732597, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Which one of you took this shot?  :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=731727" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/935/120/731727.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/935/120/731727.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/935/120/731727.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I''m guessing it was the 600mm dude.  He-he.<br/> <br/>BTW - Great choice for this challenge.  Good luck!<br/> <br/>edit to update thumb image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-29 08:33:04.</i></td>', 'Ok.  Which one of you took this shot?  :-)   I''m guessing it was the 600mm dude.  He-he. BTW - Great choice for this challenge.  Good luck! edit to update thumb image.', '2008-10-24 14:06:43.000000', '2008-10-29 08:33:04.000000', 1),
(5023439, 732710, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject choice...why a plastic container to display it?!  A wooden bowl in the top right with the jewelry spilling out onto the red bg would have given this a much richer feel &amp; look.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful subject choice...why a plastic container to display it?!  A wooden bowl in the top right with the jewelry spilling out onto the red bg would have given this a much richer feel & look.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-24 14:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
