(5029905, 732436, 83313, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a really good score in your first challenge! As I said in our PM exchange, you will often receive opposite opinions on the same aspect of your shot. Of course, I was one of the minority who did not like the color cast, but I see many preferred the way it looked. (You know what opinions are like, right?)<br/> <br/>Again, a well done first entry, and welcome to the madhouse!</td>', 'Congrats on a really good score in your first challenge! As I said in our PM exchange, you will often receive opposite opinions on the same aspect of your shot. Of course, I was one of the minority who did not like the color cast, but I see many preferred the way it looked. (You know what opinions are like, right?) Again, a well done first entry, and welcome to the madhouse!', '2008-10-29 00:08:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5029908, 732890, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol uhhhh i never would have thought anything other than maybe wine or champagne in the glass lol.  Nope, did not guess this was yours.  I thought you did the woody one where it was about to get stomped on hehe. <br/> <br/>Love the lighting in this and I thought the arrangement of items was very good.  I would have figured this to finish ahead of mine.  :/</td>', 'lol uhhhh i never would have thought anything other than maybe wine or champagne in the glass lol.  Nope, did not guess this was yours.  I thought you did the woody one where it was about to get stomped on hehe.  Love the lighting in this and I thought the arrangement of items was very good.  I would have figured this to finish ahead of mine.  :/', '2008-10-29 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5029910, 732312, 68947, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon!  It was really very well done!<br/> <br/>And, to Hesitant....hairy arm?  Try FEATHERS or fur! ROFL!</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon!  It was really very well done! And, to Hesitant....hairy arm?  Try FEATHERS or fur! ROFL!', '2008-10-29 00:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5029915, 732785, 9602, '<td valign="top">I got a lot of comments asking how this fits affluence.  How does an expensive house or car or jewelry show affluence.  Someone spent millions of dollars to build this in a remote location for no tangible return on investment. And what does the biggest donor get out of it...to name it, that is affluence. But thank you for all of the comments.  This is the only photography session that made me dizzy, or was that the lack of oxygen at 14,000 ft.</td>', 'I got a lot of comments asking how this fits affluence.  How does an expensive house or car or jewelry show affluence.  Someone spent millions of dollars to build this in a remote location for no tangible return on investment. And what does the biggest donor get out of it...to name it, that is affluence. But thank you for all of the comments.  This is the only photography session that made me dizzy, or was that the lack of oxygen at 14,000 ft.', '2008-10-29 00:09:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5029916, 732425, 46778, '<td valign="top">Great job. Nice pic / house. Go team germany</td>', 'Great job. Nice pic / house. Go team germany', '2008-10-29 00:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
