(5029943, 732774, 68947, '<td valign="top">I had no clue this was yours but, I smiled because it looks like the mass of things that I''ve also accumlated!  Nothing REAL, of course! LOL<br/> <br/>I really like the assortment of shapes, colors as well as my fave part....the sparkles off of it all.  Just call it Blingage! Nicely done!  I really thought this one was heading for at least, the top 10.  But, nice call on your score bet!  .002 off.  You be either psychic or psycho from DPC challenges, scores and comments! ;)</td>', 'I had no clue this was yours but, I smiled because it looks like the mass of things that I''ve also accumlated!  Nothing REAL, of course! LOL I really like the assortment of shapes, colors as well as my fave part....the sparkles off of it all.  Just call it Blingage! Nicely done!  I really thought this one was heading for at least, the top 10.  But, nice call on your score bet!  .002 off.  You be either psychic or psycho from DPC challenges, scores and comments! ;)', '2008-10-29 00:18:50.000000', NULL, 0),
