(5030894, 732484, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great job Steve. Splendid idea and the whole setup is a beaut. The dripping candles, textured old trunk. Cool touch using those one dollar coins?  What may have cost some slight points is that I can see some texture in the black background, near the top right side. None of the comments seemed to have mentioned it so I reckon it wasn''t a big deal , most voters didn''t see it on their monitors.</td>', 'Great job Steve. Splendid idea and the whole setup is a beaut. The dripping candles, textured old trunk. Cool touch using those one dollar coins?  What may have cost some slight points is that I can see some texture in the black background, near the top right side. None of the comments seemed to have mentioned it so I reckon it wasn''t a big deal , most voters didn''t see it on their monitors.', '2008-10-29 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 0),
