(5032197, 732825, 54232, '<td valign="top">Release the hounds was supposed to be a fox hunting metaphor for the beginning of the poverty challenge.  Hundreds of affluent photographers running out taking photos and using equipment worth months if not years of survival for many of their subjects.   I''m sure some good came out of seeing others'' plights.  I''m sure a lot more should have.  Being far from free of blame and partaking in the event I placed myself in the photo.</td>', 'Release the hounds was supposed to be a fox hunting metaphor for the beginning of the poverty challenge.  Hundreds of affluent photographers running out taking photos and using equipment worth months if not years of survival for many of their subjects.   I''m sure some good came out of seeing others'' plights.  I''m sure a lot more should have.  Being far from free of blame and partaking in the event I placed myself in the photo.', '2008-10-29 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
