(5034598, 732785, 39057, '<td valign="top">Wow...no tangible return on investment? There is not enough space to list all of that particular telescope''s discoveries but the knowledge it provides is priceless.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CraigD:</b></div><hr/><i> I got a lot of comments asking how this fits affluence.  How does an expensive house or car or jewelry show affluence.  Someone spent millions of dollars to build this in a remote location for no tangible return on investment. And what does the biggest donor get out of it...to name it, that is affluence. But thank you for all of the comments.  This is the only photography session that made me dizzy, or was that the lack of oxygen at 14,000 ft. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Wow...no tangible return on investment? There is not enough space to list all of that particular telescope''s discoveries but the knowledge it provides is priceless. Originally posted by CraigD: I got a lot of comments asking how this fits affluence.  How does an expensive house or car or jewelry show affluence.  Someone spent millions of dollars to build this in a remote location for no tangible return on investment. And what does the biggest donor get out of it...to name it, that is affluence. But thank you for all of the comments.  This is the only photography session that made me dizzy, or was that the lack of oxygen at 14,000 ft. ', '2008-10-31 15:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5036813, 732829, 99412, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 10 and if I were the only one voting you would have won hands down. The competition was tough and you deserve being in the top three. Beautiful shot.  :)</td>', 'I gave it a 10 and if I were the only one voting you would have won hands down. The competition was tough and you deserve being in the top three. Beautiful shot.  :)', '2008-11-01 15:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
